 {
  "slug": "2024山海集-小鎮眾神會",
  "title": "2024山海集-小鎮眾神會",
  "hidden": false,
  "summary": "2024山海集在編輯群的努力下終於現身了。今年度以地方信仰為主題，從小鎮眾神會出發，探討信仰與聚落的形成、人與信仰關係，不分東西方，信仰一直都是人們的精神支柱，也為社會的形成帶來莫大的影響。",
  "cover": "https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0001.jpg",
  "body": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2024山海集在編輯群的努力下終於現身了。今年度以地方信仰為主題，從小鎮眾神會出發，探討信仰與聚落的形成、人與信仰關係，不分東西方，信仰一直都是人們的精神支柱，也為社會的形成帶來莫大的影響。</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">●小鎮眾神會 有拜有保庇</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"3105\" data-permalink=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/2024/12/23/2024%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86-%e5%b0%8f%e9%8e%ae%e7%9c%be%e7%a5%9e%e6%9c%83/2024%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86-1030_page-0003-%e8%a4%87%e8%a3%bd/\" data-orig-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0003-e8a487e8a3bd.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"2296,1516\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"2024山海集 1030_page-0003 &amp;#8211; 複製\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0003-e8a487e8a3bd.jpg?w=750\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"676\" src=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0003-e8a487e8a3bd.jpg?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3105\" srcset=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0003-e8a487e8a3bd.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0003-e8a487e8a3bd.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0003-e8a487e8a3bd.jpg?w=150 150w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0003-e8a487e8a3bd.jpg?w=300 300w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0003-e8a487e8a3bd.jpg?w=768 768w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0003-e8a487e8a3bd.jpg?w=1440 1440w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>《2024山海集-小鎮眾神會》目錄</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">✝️原來，馬偕到過中港傳教很多次？<br>⛩️原來，竹南有神社？<br>👥原來，竹南的媽祖信仰也跟族群紛爭有關？<br>㊗️原來，神明真的會幫忙創業？</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"3109\" data-permalink=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/2024/12/23/2024%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86-%e5%b0%8f%e9%8e%ae%e7%9c%be%e7%a5%9e%e6%9c%83/2024%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86-1030_page-0011/\" data-orig-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0011.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"2422,1536\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"2024山海集 1030_page-0011\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0011.jpg?w=750\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"649\" src=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0011.jpg?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3109\" srcset=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0011.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0011.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0011.jpg?w=150 150w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0011.jpg?w=300 300w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0011.jpg?w=768 768w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0011.jpg?w=1440 1440w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>三神鼎立的頂廟仔聚落-中正路街角多元信仰的共存。</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">這一期的山海集我們探訪了地方的信仰場域，找出神明的管轄疆界，也與信仰的服侍者對談，聊聊他們對信仰的看法，信仰不分東西，而是將信仰與人與聚落的關係梳理出來，透過一步一腳印的踏查，記下街庄廟口、田頭田尾的靈性互動，從文字、照片、插圖到封面，不斷突破與創新，希望帶給讀者引起共鳴的內容。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"3107\" data-permalink=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/2024/12/23/2024%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86-%e5%b0%8f%e9%8e%ae%e7%9c%be%e7%a5%9e%e6%9c%83/2024%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86-1030_page-0021/\" data-orig-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0021.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"2422,1536\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"2024山海集 1030_page-0021\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0021.jpg?w=750\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"649\" src=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0021.jpg?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3107\" srcset=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0021.jpg?w=1024 1024w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0021.jpg?w=2048 2048w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0021.jpg?w=150 150w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0021.jpg?w=300 300w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0021.jpg?w=768 768w, https://huansia30.home.blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86-1030_page-0021.jpg?w=1440 1440w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>竹南鎮上特有的歲時祭儀。</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2024山海集現已出刊，歡迎到陳家古厝翻閱購買，一同與我們走入小鎮眾神的神秘領域。亦可前往番社好市集網購➡<strong><a href=\"https://www.huansiaeshop.com/products/2022%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%B1%B1%E6%B5%B7%E9%9B%86-1-1\">2024山海集</a></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">想看本期山海集相關報導移駕➡<strong><a href=\"https://youtu.be/pdVYzjVzoLg?feature=shared\">竹南小鎮眾神會 蕃社30山海集新刊</a></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
