 {
  "slug": "2022山海集秋季號",
  "title": "2022山海集秋季號",
  "hidden": false,
  "summary": "飲食與地方風土、語言、人類社會結構有著密不可分的關係，從人類學角度看飲食習慣饒富一番趣味，更引動人們想探究嘴裡這一口美味的來源與故事。",
  "cover": "https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2023-03-23-e4b88ae58d8811.37.42.png",
  "body": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"809\" height=\"1023\" data-attachment-id=\"2273\" data-permalink=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/2023/03/23/2022%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86%e7%a7%8b%e5%ad%a3%e8%99%9f/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94/\" data-orig-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94.png\" data-orig-size=\"886,1121\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94.png?w=750\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94.png?w=809\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2273\" srcset=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94.png?w=809 809w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94.png?w=119 119w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94.png?w=237 237w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94.png?w=768 768w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e5b081e99da2e59c96e6aa94.png 886w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 809px) 100vw, 809px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">人類的飲食記憶從出生的第一口食物開始，隨著生理成長、社會環境、居住遷徙等因素構成一層又一層的記憶。小小台灣島有著非常不同的飲食脈絡，從氣候、土壤、族群、生產方式都大大的影響著日復一日的吃食習慣，有些食物外貌相似口味卻大不同，或是相同食材、相同製作方式卻在不同地區有不同稱呼。飲食與地方風土、語言、人類社會結構有著密不可分的關係，從人類學角度看飲食習慣饒富一番趣味，更引動人們想探究嘴裡這一口美味的來源與故事。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img data-attachment-id=\"2278\" data-permalink=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889-36-23-2/\" data-orig-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.23-edited.png\" data-orig-size=\"819,512\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.23\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.23-edited.png?w=750\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.23-edited.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2278\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">這一期的山海集以「食」食物，「貨」產地貨源、「集」採購集散地等三大主軸，找出流域內獨特飲食習慣、物產來源與販售集散地等資料，串連食物與地方人文風土，縱橫交織出有故事的竹南小鎮食散策。</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignleft size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"807\" height=\"1023\" data-attachment-id=\"2280\" data-permalink=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/2023/03/23/2022%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86%e7%a7%8b%e5%ad%a3%e8%99%9f/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889-36-45/\" data-orig-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.45.png\" data-orig-size=\"883,1120\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.45\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.45.png?w=750\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.45.png?w=807\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2280\" srcset=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.45.png?w=807 807w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.45.png?w=118 118w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.45.png?w=237 237w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.45.png?w=768 768w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2022-10-20-e4b88ae58d889.36.45.png 883w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 807px) 100vw, 807px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">2022山海集內頁：現代人外食比例</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">從清晨到夜晚，人類為了續命看似脫不開吃食，但其實除了維持生命所需，更多的是因為地方風土、烹調技術、社會結構與生活環境等演變產生的飲食文化。這期的山海集我們從飲食出發，踏尋竹南人的一日吃食生活圈，試圖從店家的手藝中了解竹南在地的口味，也走訪鄰近崎頂丘陵區，尋找最貼近一方土水的農漁生活，更走入市場的日常，將喧鬧有機的市場風景化為文字，紀錄集市的生命力。</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"730\" data-attachment-id=\"2284\" data-permalink=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/2023/03/23/2022%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86%e7%a7%8b%e5%ad%a3%e8%99%9f/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-110901/\" data-orig-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-110901.png\" data-orig-size=\"621,730\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-110901\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-110901.png?w=621\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-110901.png?w=621\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2284\" srcset=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-110901.png 621w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-110901.png?w=128 128w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-110901.png?w=255 255w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 621px) 100vw, 621px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">編輯群幾週的採訪工作，討論著為了收集題材而連續吃了好幾天的蛋餅或是麵食，感覺到體重機上的數字微微顫抖，笑說是職業傷害。今年的採訪團隊加入了竹南高中學生美食搜查隊，從高中生的角度來看看年輕人喜愛的美食有哪些，讓題材從在地的飲食文化脈絡，隨著區域發展、人口流動跨越過去與現在。</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"583\" height=\"743\" data-attachment-id=\"2286\" data-permalink=\"https://huansia30.home.blog/2023/03/23/2022%e5%b1%b1%e6%b5%b7%e9%9b%86%e7%a7%8b%e5%ad%a3%e8%99%9f/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-111427/\" data-orig-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-111427.png\" data-orig-size=\"583,743\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-111427\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-111427.png?w=583\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-111427.png?w=583\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2286\" srcset=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-111427.png 583w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-111427.png?w=118 118w, https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2-2023-03-23-111427.png?w=235 235w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 583px) 100vw, 583px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">每年山海集總是匯聚了巨大的在地能量，從題材發想、資料收集、採訪、撰稿、攝影到最後的美編，這股力量凝聚成型，潑灑在刊物的字裡行間，透過印刷出版傳遞出竹南小鎮的文化能量。這本刊物的出版與延續是集眾人之力的成果，苗栗縣在地文化推廣協會三年來受到勞動部多元就業方案的計畫支持，讓番社文化基地站穩腳步，順利的推動地方文化教育與山海集的出刊，在文化創生的路上，我們感謝每一位伸出援手的夥伴，因為有你們的支持，我們才能走得更遠更久。</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.huansiaeshop.com/collections/feature-on-homepage/products/2022最新山海集\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">更多精彩內容，就在2022山海集</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li>延伸閱讀⬇︎</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://wp.me/pbJ7fh-EW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">2023山海集秋季號</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://wp.me/pbJ7fh-vN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">2021山海集秋季號</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://wp.me/sbJ7fh-2020at\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">2020山海集秋季號</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://wp.me/pbJ7fh-fW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">2020山海集夏季號</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
